Subject: [PATCH] Ask AI with a local model: no consent box, sent from the preview, longer wait

A question asked from a recording's preview (or its Summary and Action items buttons) used to open
AI Chat with the question filled in and wait for a consent box, so nothing was sent. With a model on
this computer (Ollama, LM Studio) no transcript leaves the computer, so the consent box is replaced
by a note and the question is sent at once; a cloud provider still asks for consent. Local models get
up to 5 minutes per request (cloud stays at 90 seconds) and AI Chat waits up to 5.5 minutes. A JSON
answer from LM Studio inside a code fence or after a lead-in line is unwrapped instead of failing.
AI Chat names LM Studio in its header and progress line.
